// An option's text can't pause, change speed or run commands.

== fixture.option_text
-> Wait {w} here
//      ^^^ PIB2101
-> Pause {pause 0.5} here
//       ^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB2101
-> A newer page{page}
//             ^^^^^^ PIB2101
-> Jolt {@jolt mira}
//      ^^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB2101
-> {if $a}Wait{w}{/if}
//            ^^^ PIB2101
-> Fast {speed 2}
//      ^^^^^^^^^ PIB2101

// Must not trigger

-> [b]Bold[/b] {$name} {icon interact} {if $a}yes{/if}{br}line two
mira: Text lines can {w} pause{page}, {speed 2}speed up{speed} and {@jolt mira} run commands.
